1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,100
The king asked who they
were. Whose they were.

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,000
Viśvāmitra answered slowly.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,900
They don't come on their own,
he said. Someone sets them on.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Rāvaṇa.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,600
King of the rākṣasas. Brother
of Kubera. He has a boon.

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,800
Dasharatha heard the name.

7
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:31,900
He said he couldn't
stand against

8
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,000
Rāvaṇa, nor could his army.

9
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,300
How, he asked, could a boy?

10
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,700
Once more... he said no.
